{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>根據公告，百度於香港聯交所上市的普通股，及於納斯達克全球精選市場上市的美國存託股，將持續可予轉換。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/498979849d5c559.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/236ca2d44a6eeed.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>今日，百度港股盤中報94.25港元，跌幅2.03%，總市值約2566億港元。隔夜美股（BIDU）收於95.28美元，下跌1.89%，總市值約323.18億美元。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/d66c027d590fdcc.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/498979849d5c559.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0901/236ca2d44a6eeed.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T04:58:37.206011+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}